From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
uiautomationcore: IUIAutomation comparison, rect and timeout methods

CompareElements and CompareRuntimeIds compare runtime ids, RectToVariant,
VariantToRect and SafeArrayToRectNativeArray convert between rectangles and
arrays of doubles (left, top, width, height), the AutoSetFocus, connection
and transaction timeout properties are kept (defaults on, 2000 and 20000),
and ElementFromIAccessible wraps an IAccessible in a provider.
